{
  "id": "workout-replan-sealed-holdout-v3",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "finished-partial-replacement-and-query",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "今天这场先结束了，我印象还有三个动作各一组没做，帮我确认当前目标别把结束当全做完。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop",
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "done_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "not_all_complete": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "已经练的都保留，但旧的剩余先不做了，帮我新排十四分钟。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "是的，保留之前的完成记录，放弃旧剩余，现在先给我预览新目标。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 14
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "这个目标合适，确认让它生效。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "新的一套我一组也没练，请把新进度和之前留档的组数分开给我看。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "active-one-set-archive-and-scope-query",
      "fixture": "partial_active",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我在刚才的动作只练了一组，现在原来剩下的不练，另排十三分钟，已练的给我留底。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "没错，换掉未做部分就行，做过的照存，先让我看十三分钟的目标。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1,
            "max_minutes": 13
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "好，这份新安排现在应用吧。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "old_status": "superseded",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "查查我留底的那组，再说下这次新目标目前到底做了多少，两个别混。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}